  "body": "Discover Mediterranean charm, privacy and spacious family living in the heart of sought-after Glendowie.\r\n\r\nSet on approximately 508m² of freehold land, this distinctive home features Mediterranean-inspired architecture, warm exterior tones and an elegant arched entrance, offering timeless character and charm.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the entertainer's kitchen flows beautifully into the family living and formal dining areas, creating an inviting space for everyday living and memorable gatherings. A separate, spacious lounge is perfect for relaxing or enjoying movie nights, while multiple living areas offer flexibility and privacy for growing or extended families.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n\r\n*\t4 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms\r\n*\tMultiple spacious living and entertaining areas\r\n*\tEntertainer's kitchen and formal dining\r\n*\tExcellent privacy and flexible family living\r\n*\tDouble garage plus off-street parking\r\n*\tZoned for Glendowie School and Glendowie College\r\n*\tClose to St Heliers Village, beaches, parks and cafés\r\n\r\nYour own private Mediterranean retreat, right here in Glendowie.\r\n\r\nCome and experience its charm for yourself!\r\n\r\nContact Rachel today to arrange your viewing.",
